insert into cpl_memory (slug,kind,title,summary,tags,source,author,event_date) values
('d-first-light-marks-spent-by-merged-apply-s643','decision','First Light marks are spent only by a merged Apply','The S643 conductor, 2026-11-12 (#3181, #3183): each Apply writes applied_through_mark_id per set, and held_mark_ids for marks it could not apply, into the committed lists; tab and script ignore spent marks. The value reaches main only when Sam merges the Apply PR; a PR closed unmerged leaves its marks live. A Keep never adds. The build fails on __needs_words__ in blurb, setting or alt.',array['first-light','sierra','decision'],'Session call, S643 (SkyLark, the conductor, session 01Rvwe2YCKxdVk7Nko4fCC4Z); docs/reference/lanes/sierra-page-redesign.md; issue 3153 comment 6836322166','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12'),
('d-first-light-marks-tables-applied-s643','decision','first_light_marks and first_light_apply_requests applied to Supabase','The S643 conductor, 2026-11-12 21:31Z: migration s643_first_light_marks applied on push (run 43310349633) after a four-reader review. Verified 21:33Z: anon no grant; authenticated INSERT and SELECT behind is_allowed_reviewer; stamp functions service_role only; ids identity ALWAYS; 0 rows. Receipt migration_s643_first_light_marks_43310349633.json; rollback beside the migration.',array['first-light','supabase','decision'],'Session call, S643 (SkyLark, the conductor, session 01Rvwe2YCKxdVk7Nko4fCC4Z); PR 3181; kb/receipts/migration_s643_first_light_marks_43310349633.json; kb/migrations/2026-11-12_first_light_marks_rollback.sql','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12'),
('d-daily-rebuild-on-changed-input-s643','decision','The daily run rebuilds once when a clean rebase changes a build input','The S643 conductor, 2026-11-12 (#3180, COBIx #3110 finding 8''s gap): after a clean rebase, an incoming path outside docs/ and tests/ is a build input and the job rebuilds once through the conflict path''s script. A failed input rebuild publishes the first build with a warning; a failed conflict rebuild still exits 1. Adds 6 to 9 minutes; 45 of 49 recent commits count. Scratch-repo runs only so far.',array['governance-team-enablement','daily-dashboard','decision'],'Session call, S643 (SkyLark, the conductor, session 01Rvwe2YCKxdVk7Nko4fCC4Z); docs/reference/lanes/governance-team-enablement.md','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12'),
('d-returned-titles-acknowledged-list-s643','decision','Returned credential titles are an acknowledged list with a lint warning','The S643 conductor, 2026-11-12 (#3179, COBIx #3110): kb/returned_titles_acknowledged.json is append-only, seeded with three titles brought back by June 2026 saved assignments (AUTO 60A, 60B, 62A; reason not recorded). credential_aliases --check warns on an unlisted one. The Review view lists renamed titles at #exhibits/renamed. Scorecard: review list 12, unacknowledged 0.',array['cer-procedures','exhibits','decision'],'Session call, S643 (SkyLark, the conductor, session 01Rvwe2YCKxdVk7Nko4fCC4Z); docs/reference/lanes/cer-procedures.md','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12'),
('d-reclustering-district-guard-s643','decision','Re-clustering Step 1: one district is one voice; cases chosen by reach','The S643 conductor with COBIx, 2026-11-12 (#3182, #2962): a pair inside one district is one voice on splits and merges. Confirmed 678 (strong 33), split 760 (6), merge 71 (17), not enough text 348. Cases for Sam by credit-by-exam reach: AJ 160, FIRE 130 X/M1274, REAL M1038/M1040, MATH M1036/M1044, MUS 130, BUSI M1228. Subject-code check: 921 members, 321 M-IDs. No potential-CPL column yet.',array['commons','mid-reclustering','decision'],'Session call, S643 (SkyLark, the conductor, session 01Rvwe2YCKxdVk7Nko4fCC4Z); kb/status/mid_outcomes_compare_2026-11-12.md; issue 2962 comment 6835467080','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12'),
('d-docket-shared-queue-check-s643','decision','docket-process and library-publish-now share one queue check; the deploy waits for Sam','The S643 conductor, 2026-11-12 (#3184, owed from #3171): both Edge Functions import _shared/group_queue.mjs; docket-process answers 409 busy_behind when another daily-dashboard group run waits and dispatches nothing on an unread queue. Merged, NOT deployed: a production deploy is on the hold list with no standing authorization. Bundling of _shared is unproven until the first deploy.',array['library','governance-team-enablement','decision'],'Session call, S643 (SkyLark, the conductor, session 01Rvwe2YCKxdVk7Nko4fCC4Z); PR 3184; chatbox/supabase/functions/_shared/group_queue.mjs','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12'),
('p-test-pinned-to-live-held-card-s643','pitfall','A test that reads a held card from the live file fails main when a reviewer rules on it','S643, 2026-11-12: exhibits_related_actions.test.js read four real held cards from kb/exhibits_review.json; one left the list and daily commit 6ff6ab3a failed suite (6) on main and every open PR. Fix #3178: a real-data block runs only while its card is held, a skipped block still reports its checks so the floor holds, one check fails when none is left. Pin rules to fixtures.',array['tests','exhibits','pitfall'],'PR 3178; reported by the Funding Follow-up Dashboard session','SkyLark (S643)',date '2026-11-12')
